WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.390
Unit one. Reading Nutrition Labels!

2
00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:08.104
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.154 --> 00:00:11.510
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.715
Today we learn about Reading Nutrition Labels. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.866
Nutrition label. Say it with me. Nutrition label!

6
00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:28.129
Ingredient. Say it with me. Ingredient!

7
00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:35.098
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

8
00:00:38.598 --> 00:00:42.698
Serving size. Say it with me. Serving size!

9
00:00:46.197 --> 00:00:49.614
Calorie. Say it with me. Calorie!

10
00:00:53.118 --> 00:00:56.118
Fat. Say it with me. Fat!

11
00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:03.072
Fiber. Say it with me. Fiber!

12
00:01:06.538 --> 00:01:10.621
Healthy choice. Say it with me. Healthy choice!

13
00:01:14.109 --> 00:01:25.414
A nutrition label shows the ingredients, sugar, and calorie content of food. Checking the serving size helps me understand how much fat or fiber I am eating. This helps me make a healthy choice.

14
00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:26.659
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.872 --> 00:01:33.056
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:34.256
Sugar!

17
00:01:35.341 --> 00:01:40.433
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:41.633
Fiber!

19
00:01:42.406 --> 00:01:49.429
Did you know? Fiber, found in foods like whole grains and beans, helps keep your digestive system healthy!

20
00:01:49.479 --> 00:01:51.718
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.204 --> 00:02:01.617
Think and answer. Why is it useful to read a nutrition label?

22
00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:02.817
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:09.031
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.081 --> 00:02:11.641
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

